title: "Lineage-Aware Multi-Agent Governance Surface"
abstract: >-
  A selected public structural account of routing, review independence,
  capacity, evidence, convergence, and retained human authority observed in a
  high-intensity multi-agent working environment. Operator-derived,
  operationally exercised, externally unvalidated. Candidate / related surface
  with respect to Meta-Writing Ecology; not a confirmed component.
